Package: statswalesr
Type: Package
Title: Easily Extract Data from 'StatsWales'
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Jamie", "Ralph", email = "jamesryanralph@outlook.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Download data from the 'StatsWales' public API
    (<https://api.stats.gov.wales/v1>) into R. Provides functions to list
    datasets and topics, retrieve dataset views with optional filtering and
    pagination, and download data in CSV, JSON, or Excel formats.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
